 - Tasten [Ctrl] + Cursor up    -> Achsen plus
 - Tasten [Ctrl] + Cursor down  -> Achsen minus
 - Tasten [Alt] + X             -> Not Aus
 - Tasten [Ctrl] + Y            -> NC Start + NC Stop
 PC Tastatur oder Maus Bedienung
 - Tasten [Shift]+[Ctrl]+[Alt]+1 -> Vertikale Softkey 1 
   ...
 - Tasten [Shift]+[Ctrl]+[Alt]+6 -> Vertikale Softkey 6
